# Line endings — pinned in-repo so every machine agrees regardless of its own
# core.autocrlf. .gitattributes always wins over autocrlf.
#
# Added 2026-08-08. Unlike the other repos in the fleet, this was NOT a no-op
# for history: 5 files were committed as CRLF blobs (ThepGetColumn.pq,
# ThepMoveColumn.pq, ThepReplaceTextList.pq, ThepSearchColumn.pq, USAGE.md) —
# they arrived by being moved out of PowerQuery-MCode-Premium (which does pin
# eol=lf) into this repo while it had no .gitattributes at all, on a Windows
# machine. Declaring eol=lf without renormalizing would have left the
# declaration disagreeing with the blobs, so they were renormalized in the
# same commit. That is why that commit's diff rewrites those 5 files whole.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Batch files must stay CRLF — cmd.exe misparses LF-only .bat at random
# offsets. None exist here today; this is a guard for future additions.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
